### ============================================
### 用户管理模块测试 (vellastra-user :8082)
### ============================================

### 1. 分页用户列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/list?current=1&size=10&keyword=&status=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. 用户详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. 当前用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. 更新当前用户信息
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "星垂野",
  "avatar": "https://example.com/avatar.png",
  "bio": "个人简介"
}

### 5. 新增用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "password123",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "nickname": "新用户"
}

> {% client.global.set("newUserId", response.body.data); %}

### 6. 编辑用户
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/{{newUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "新用户V2",
  "email": "newuser2@example.com",
  "avatar": "https://example.com/a2.png"
}

### 7. 启用/禁用用户
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/user/{{newUserId}}/status?status=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 重置密码（管理员）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/{{newUserId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 自助修改密码
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/user/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "oldPassword": "admin123",
  "newPassword": "newpass123"
}

### 10. 删除用户（逻辑删除）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/user/{{newUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 内部 API - 用户基本信息（Feign 调用）
GET http://localhost:8082/internal/user/1
